tools.description:
Ask for a change that only the person can confirm. Nothing happens until the person opens the approval link and approves the request in the app with their own sign-in. Requests expire after 15 minutes. After approval, call refert_check_change with the returned id to see the result.

Actions and their params:
tool.delete: { slug }
tool.transfer_owner: { slug, userId }
group.delete: { id }
member.invite: { email, role?: "admin" | "member" }
member.set_role: { id, role: "admin" | "member" }
member.remove: { id, transferTo?: user id of an admin or owner, defaults to the signed-in person }
invite.revoke: { id }
workspace.rename: { name }
domain.claim: { domain }
domain.release: { domain }
